WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.601
♪♪

00:00:03.601 --> 00:00:04.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:07.467
-President Biden returned
to the White House today

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:09.167
after Queen Elizabeth's funeral.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:11.701
Of course,
now he's calling it his flat.

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:16.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.701 --> 00:00:19.300
According to a new survey,
80% of Americans said

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:22.434
that they have not cried about
the death of Queen Elizabeth,

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:24.901
while the other 20% said,

00:00:24.901 --> 00:00:26.000
"No spoilers!"

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:30.901
President Biden appeared
for an interview

00:00:30.901 --> 00:00:32.801
on last night's episode
of "60 Minutes,"

00:00:32.801 --> 00:00:34.601
or as it was known yesterday,

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:35.834
"600 Minutes."

00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:37.300
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.601
"I ever tell you about the time
I almost met Warren G. Harding?"

00:00:40.601 --> 00:00:42.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.367 --> 00:00:43.801
According to new poll,
President Biden's

00:00:43.801 --> 00:00:45.834
approval rating has hit
an 11-month high.

00:00:45.834 --> 00:00:48.767
Wow! Inflation really is
out of control.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:50.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.734 --> 00:00:53.200
Attorney General Merrick Garland
administered

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.901
the oath of allegiance
on Saturday

00:00:54.901 --> 00:00:58.501
to 200 new U.S. citizens
during a naturalization ceremony

00:00:58.501 --> 00:01:02.167
on Ellis Island and said,
"We must not allow the fractures

00:01:02.167 --> 00:01:04.901
between us
to fracture our democracy,"

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:07.601
which must have been alarming
for the new citizens.

00:01:07.601 --> 00:01:10.934
"Congratulations!
Enjoy it while it lasts."

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:12.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:15.400
After Florida governor
Ron DeSantis sent two planes

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:17.200
of migrants to Martha's Vineyard
last week,

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:20.267
Texas governor Greg Abbott
bused dozens of migrants

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:23.100
to Vice President Kamala Harris'
residence in Washington, D.C.

00:01:23.100 --> 00:01:25.067
Okay. What's going on
with these governors?

00:01:25.067 --> 00:01:27.834
It's like we radicalized
the Impractical Jokers.

00:01:27.834 --> 00:01:29.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:31.701
"Okay, now go up to him
and give him a bus ticket."

00:01:31.701 --> 00:01:34.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.834 --> 00:01:36.701
In his speech in Ohio
over the weekend,

00:01:36.701 --> 00:01:38.868
former president Trump said
that he had a

00:01:38.868 --> 00:01:41.000
"very luxurious
and enjoyable life"

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.434
before he entered politics.

00:01:42.434 --> 00:01:44.701
Dude, you didn't enter politics.

00:01:44.701 --> 00:01:47.934
You went straight to president
without even trying.

00:01:47.934 --> 00:01:51.367
Don't make it sound like you
gave up your medical practice

00:01:51.367 --> 00:01:55.033
to go door-to-door, campaigning
for city comptroller.

00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:56.667
You had a nice house,

00:01:56.667 --> 00:01:58.033
and then, for a while,

00:01:58.033 --> 00:01:59.601
you had two nice houses.

00:01:59.601 --> 00:02:01.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:03.868
Two radio hosts in New Jersey
are facing criticism

00:02:03.868 --> 00:02:06.100
after voicing support
for teachers

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.200
who have been accused of
having sex with students.

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:11.601
For what it's worth, the radio
hosts have issued an apology

00:02:11.601 --> 00:02:14.434
and a genuinely remorseful
sound effect.

00:02:14.434 --> 00:02:15.901
[ Sad trombone ]

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:18.334
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:25.367
Kanye West announced last week
that he has terminated

00:02:25.367 --> 00:02:27.634
his partnership with
the clothing company Gap.

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:30.734
Instead, he's going
with Ann Taylor Loft.

00:02:30.734 --> 00:02:32.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.234 --> 00:02:38.000
And, finally,
producers have announced

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.167
that "Phantom of the Opera,"
which is the longest-running

00:02:40.167 --> 00:02:42.100
Broadway show,
will close next year.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:46.100
Said one man, "Oh, sure, right
when masks become optional."

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:48.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:50.000
"I was gonna leave it on!"

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.067 --> 00:02:54.467
President Biden claimed
in a new interview

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:56.300
that the coronavirus pandemic
is over.

00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:59.200
Well, easy for him to say --
he just had it.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.534
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.534 --> 00:03:02.601
Of course, it's over when
you've got the antibodies.

00:03:02.601 --> 00:03:05.400
"I'm off to Burning Man and then
London for the Queen's funeral.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:08.234
No masks. No masks."

00:03:08.234 --> 00:03:11.934
CBS is facing criticism over
its decision to end coverage

00:03:11.934 --> 00:03:14.167
of Queen Elizabeth's funeral
yesterday

00:03:14.167 --> 00:03:16.634
in order to air episodes of
"Let's Make a Deal,"

00:03:16.634 --> 00:03:18.334
and "The Price is Right."

00:03:18.334 --> 00:03:20.801
Though, if you're a fan
of those two shows,

00:03:20.801 --> 00:03:23.200
you've probably seen plenty
of funerals.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.534
That's right -- They cut away
from Queen Elizabeth's funeral

00:03:30.534 --> 00:03:32.868
yesterday to air episodes of
"Let's Make a Deal"

00:03:32.868 --> 00:03:35.000
and "The Price is Right,"
or as the British Empire

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.868
used to call those,
foreign policy.

00:03:36.868 --> 00:03:39.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:41.100
Former President Trump has
reportedly said

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:44.033
that Florida governor
Ron DeSantis stole his idea

00:03:44.033 --> 00:03:46.100
to send migrants
to different states.

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.634
Also, his idea of

00:03:47.634 --> 00:03:49.734
standing like it's
your first time.

00:03:49.734 --> 00:03:52.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.634
Amazon founder Jeff Bezos
recently dropped

00:04:01.634 --> 00:04:03.267
on the Bloomberg
Billionaire Index

00:04:03.267 --> 00:04:05.200
to the third-richest person
in the world.

00:04:05.200 --> 00:04:07.868
He lost his spot when he bought
a Tesla.

00:04:07.868 --> 00:04:10.868
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.868 --> 00:04:13.434
Former Secretary of State
Mike Pompeo spoke this morning

00:04:13.434 --> 00:04:16.267
at the New Hampshire Institute
of Politics speaker series,

00:04:16.267 --> 00:04:17.934
titled, "Politics and Eggs,"

00:04:17.934 --> 00:04:20.968
I assume as one of the eggs?

00:04:20.968 --> 00:04:23.968
[ Laughter ]

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:27.734
I-I assume.

00:04:27.734 --> 00:04:30.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.934
It wasn't a joke.
It was an assumption.

00:04:31.934 --> 00:04:33.968
I don't...

00:04:33.968 --> 00:04:35.434
Pompeo criticized
President Biden

00:04:35.434 --> 00:04:37.634
for his recent speech
attacking the MAGA movement,

00:04:37.634 --> 00:04:40.367
and said, quote, "Treating
your countryman like enemies

00:04:40.367 --> 00:04:43.234
is a rejection of the principles
that make America great."

00:04:43.234 --> 00:04:46.267
Oh, so maybe they were chanting
"Hug Mike Pence."

00:04:46.267 --> 00:04:49.267
[ Laughter ]

00:04:50.701 --> 00:04:53.467
Tampa Bay Buccaneers
Quarterback Tom Brady apologized

00:04:53.467 --> 00:04:55.868
on Sunday after throwing
a tablet on the sidelines.

00:04:55.868 --> 00:04:57.334
To be fair, new technology

00:04:57.334 --> 00:04:59.934
can be hard for boomers
to figure out.

00:04:59.934 --> 00:05:03.234
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.234 --> 00:05:05.234
A lawyer in Kentucky was
recently suspended

00:05:05.234 --> 00:05:07.601
after he allegedly offered
to help a defendant

00:05:07.601 --> 00:05:09.601
in exchange for nude photos.

00:05:09.601 --> 00:05:12.701
It's the rare case of a lawyer
trying to get himself off.

00:05:12.701 --> 00:05:15.734
[ Laughter ]

00:05:21.734 --> 00:05:24.601
Scollins? Yeah, Scollins.

00:05:24.601 --> 00:05:27.734
And finally, Christmas is now
less than 100 days away.

00:05:27.734 --> 00:05:29.634
Or, if you ask Costco, six.

00:05:29.634 --> 00:05:31.300
[ Laughter ]

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:32.667
Well, it's Wednesday,

00:05:32.667 --> 00:05:35.667
so it's time for Donald Trump's
crime of the week.

00:05:35.667 --> 00:05:38.167
What is it this week?

00:05:38.167 --> 00:05:40.100
Did he tie a lady
to some train tracks?

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:41.501
Did he blow up city hall?

00:05:41.501 --> 00:05:45.367
Oh, massive tax fraud,
the old classic.

00:05:45.367 --> 00:05:46.667
[ Laughter ]

00:05:46.667 --> 00:05:48.734
New York attorney general
Letitia James today

00:05:48.734 --> 00:05:51.634
filed an over-200-page
civil fraud lawsuit

00:05:51.634 --> 00:05:54.133
against former president Trump,
several of his children,

00:05:54.133 --> 00:05:56.467
business partners
in The Trump Organization.

00:05:56.467 --> 00:05:58.267
I'd say he needs a good lawyer,

00:05:58.267 --> 00:06:01.667
but that's been true
for a while now.

00:06:01.667 --> 00:06:04.467
[ Laughter ]

00:06:04.467 --> 00:06:06.133
In the new lawsuit filed today,

00:06:06.133 --> 00:06:08.167
New York attorney general
Letitia James

00:06:08.167 --> 00:06:10.100
alleges that
The Trump Organization

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:12.868
deceived lenders, insurers,
and tax officials

00:06:12.868 --> 00:06:15.634
by inflating the value
of its properties.

00:06:15.634 --> 00:06:19.934
Even worse, he listed himself
as 6'7" on his Tinder profile.

00:06:19.934 --> 00:06:22.734
[ Laughter ]

00:06:22.734 --> 00:06:25.667
President Biden
hosted a reception today

00:06:25.667 --> 00:06:28.234
at New York's American Museum
of Natural History,

00:06:28.234 --> 00:06:31.234
where he also spent some time
catching up with old friends.

00:06:31.234 --> 00:06:32.267
"Chompy!"

00:06:32.267 --> 00:06:33.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:33.501 --> 00:06:35.033
"It's been ages, Chompy.

00:06:35.033 --> 00:06:38.434
Ohh! Oh, God, no, Chompy."

00:06:38.434 --> 00:06:40.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:43.434 --> 00:06:45.667
"What did they do to you,
Chompy?"

00:06:45.667 --> 00:06:47.834
[ Laughter ]

00:06:47.834 --> 00:06:50.734
Russia announced plans
to hold an annexation vote

00:06:50.734 --> 00:06:52.601
in occupied portions of Ukraine.

00:06:52.601 --> 00:06:54.167
And this is cool --
They also announced

00:06:54.167 --> 00:06:56.300
what the results
of the vote will be.

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:58.667
[ Laughter ]

00:06:58.667 --> 00:07:00.467
You don't have to stay up late.

00:07:00.467 --> 00:07:02.501
[ Laughter ]

00:07:02.501 --> 00:07:03.901
According to the latest numbers,

00:07:03.901 --> 00:07:06.300
Facebook CEO Mark Zuckerberg's
net worth

00:07:06.300 --> 00:07:08.868
decreased this year
by more than $71 billion.

00:07:08.868 --> 00:07:11.067
No wonder he wants to live
in the metaverse.

00:07:11.067 --> 00:07:13.534
He can't afford a place
in San Francisco anymore.

00:07:13.534 --> 00:07:15.100
[ Laughter ]

00:07:15.100 --> 00:07:17.634
The 22nd annual
Congressional Basketball Game

00:07:17.634 --> 00:07:19.100
was held on Monday night,

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:22.067
and the team of Congress people
beat the team of lobbyists.

00:07:22.067 --> 00:07:25.567
Or -- just throwing this
out there -- they let you win.

00:07:25.567 --> 00:07:28.400
[ Laughter ]

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:31.667
A man in Kentucky recently
set a Guinness world record

00:07:31.667 --> 00:07:35.701
after driving a mile in reverse
in just over 75 seconds.

00:07:35.701 --> 00:07:38.601
He then smartly refused
the breathalyzer.

00:07:38.601 --> 00:07:40.601
[ Laughter ]

00:07:40.601 --> 00:07:42.767
"Oh, what?
I set a world record?

00:07:42.767 --> 00:07:44.267
Alright!"

00:07:46.300 --> 00:07:48.767
According to new survey,
3% of Americans

00:07:48.767 --> 00:07:51.467
said that they have waited
in a line for over eight hours.

00:07:51.467 --> 00:07:54.467
"Well, we're still not opening
a second register,"

00:07:54.467 --> 00:07:55.701
said CVS.

00:07:55.701 --> 00:07:57.467
[ Laughter ]

00:07:59.334 --> 00:08:02.033
And finally, officials
from the CDC said this week

00:08:02.033 --> 00:08:05.200
that there was a 26% rise
in syphilis infections

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:06.200
reported last year.

00:08:06.200 --> 00:08:07.567
Well, good luck with that.

00:08:07.567 --> 00:08:10.934
We couldn't even get people
to wear masks.

00:08:10.934 --> 00:08:13.000
[ Laughter ]

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:16.200
President Biden addressed the
UN General Assembly yesterday

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:18.901
and said that the Russian
invasion of Ukraine

00:08:18.901 --> 00:08:21.667
"is about extinguishing
Ukraine's right

00:08:21.667 --> 00:08:23.133
to exist as a state,"

00:08:23.133 --> 00:08:27.234
and 9 out of 10 times,
I agree we shouldn't do that.

00:08:27.234 --> 00:08:30.567
[ Laughter ]

00:08:30.567 --> 00:08:32.501
In the same speech,
President Biden addressed

00:08:32.501 --> 00:08:33.934
the ongoing invasion in Ukraine

00:08:33.934 --> 00:08:37.067
and said, "Russia has shamefully
violated the core tenets

00:08:37.067 --> 00:08:38.968
of the United Nations Charter,

00:08:38.968 --> 00:08:40.968
not to mention the dress code.

00:08:40.968 --> 00:08:42.734
[ Laughter ]

00:08:42.734 --> 00:08:44.934
Ukrainian President
Volodymyr Zelenskyy

00:08:44.934 --> 00:08:47.534
addressed the
UN General Assembly yesterday

00:08:47.534 --> 00:08:49.100
in a pre-recorded speech,

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:51.334
and it must have been
very pre-recorded,

00:08:51.334 --> 00:08:53.767
'cause he said,
"Everything's great."

00:08:53.767 --> 00:08:55.767
[ Laughter ]

00:08:55.767 --> 00:08:59.501
The House yesterday
voted 229 to 203

00:08:59.501 --> 00:09:02.133
to overhaul
the Electoral Count Act.

00:09:02.133 --> 00:09:04.734
Though, somehow
that wasn't a majority.

00:09:04.734 --> 00:09:07.400
[ Laughter ]

00:09:08.634 --> 00:09:11.300
[ Laughter ]

00:09:13.667 --> 00:09:16.267
Always put math in the jokes.

00:09:16.267 --> 00:09:18.267
[ Laughter ]

00:09:18.267 --> 00:09:20.234
People love to do that math.

00:09:20.234 --> 00:09:22.534
[ Laughter ]

00:09:22.534 --> 00:09:25.701
President Biden issued
a major disaster declaration

00:09:25.701 --> 00:09:27.033
yesterday for Puerto Rico,

00:09:27.033 --> 00:09:30.234
but thankfully Governor DeSantis
is already sending help.

00:09:30.234 --> 00:09:33.734
[ Laughter ]

00:09:33.734 --> 00:09:36.033
In an interview
on Fox News last night,

00:09:36.033 --> 00:09:37.801
former President Trump defended

00:09:37.801 --> 00:09:39.567
his handling
of sensitive materials

00:09:39.567 --> 00:09:43.067
and said that he had the power
to declassify documents

00:09:43.067 --> 00:09:44.834
"even by thinking about it."

00:09:44.834 --> 00:09:45.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:45.868 --> 00:09:47.200
Oh, great.

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:49.901
So, on top of everything else,
Trump has The Shining.

00:09:49.901 --> 00:09:50.968
Well...

00:09:50.968 --> 00:09:52.834
[ Laughter ]

00:09:52.834 --> 00:09:55.200
...that explains
his luck with hotels.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:57.601
[ Laughter ]

00:09:57.601 --> 00:10:00.000
In the same interview,
former President Trump claimed

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.901
that the agents who raided
his Mar-a-Lago home

00:10:02.901 --> 00:10:06.968
took his will and said it could
"cause a lot of problems

00:10:06.968 --> 00:10:08.033
if it's published,"

00:10:08.033 --> 00:10:10.701
'cause not everyone
made the cut.

00:10:10.701 --> 00:10:13.801
[ Laughter ]

00:10:13.801 --> 00:10:17.400
A banner was raised
in Madison Square Garden

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:18.701
last night celebrating...

00:10:18.701 --> 00:10:20.133
[ Women cheering ]

00:10:20.133 --> 00:10:21.267
[ Laughter ]

00:10:21.267 --> 00:10:23.501
Get it out of your system.
He's not here.

00:10:23.501 --> 00:10:24.901
[ Laughter ]

00:10:24.901 --> 00:10:27.868
He's not gonna see this.
He's not gonna know you cheered.

00:10:27.868 --> 00:10:29.667
[ Laughter ]

00:10:29.667 --> 00:10:31.868
[ Laughs ]

00:10:34.367 --> 00:10:36.000
And, by the way, buddy,
if you are watching,

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:37.000
I'm so sorry I said that.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.434
We'd love to have you.

00:10:38.434 --> 00:10:41.033
If you're in your hotel
after a concert right now

00:10:41.033 --> 00:10:42.868
relaxing with "Late Night"
and you just saw that joke,

00:10:42.868 --> 00:10:43.701
I'm sorry.

00:10:43.701 --> 00:10:44.734
I didn't mean it, buddy.

00:10:44.734 --> 00:10:45.934
[ Laughter ]

00:10:45.934 --> 00:10:48.100
A banner was raised
in Madison Square Garden

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:49.767
last night celebrating
Harry Styles'

00:10:49.767 --> 00:10:51.067
15 nights of concerts.

00:10:51.067 --> 00:10:53.667
"Plenty of room up there,"
said Knicks fans.

00:10:53.667 --> 00:10:57.367
[ Laughter ]

00:10:57.367 --> 00:11:00.968
World champs -- 1973.

00:11:00.968 --> 00:11:02.167
Harry Styles.

00:11:02.167 --> 00:11:04.968
[ Laughter ]

00:11:06.367 --> 00:11:08.334
Today was the first day of fall,

00:11:08.334 --> 00:11:12.701
and due to climate change, this
is how the leaves are changing.

00:11:12.701 --> 00:11:14.567
That was taken in Vermont.

00:11:14.567 --> 00:11:16.634
[ Laughter ]

00:11:16.634 --> 00:11:18.400
And finally,
Taco Bell has announced

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:21.167
that it will begin testing
its new meatless carne asada

00:11:21.167 --> 00:11:24.167
next month at dozens
of locations in Dayton, Ohio,

00:11:24.167 --> 00:11:25.634
raising the question --

00:11:25.634 --> 00:11:29.033
how many Taco Bells
does Dayton, Ohio, need?

00:11:29.033 --> 00:11:30.734
[ Laughter ]

00:11:30.734 --> 00:11:32.467
But true story --
I tried to book a flight

00:11:32.467 --> 00:11:34.701
to Dayton today
after I heard this news,

00:11:34.701 --> 00:11:35.834
and they were available.

00:11:35.834 --> 00:11:38.601
[ Laughter ]

00:11:38.601 --> 00:11:40.467
That was a monologue, everybody!

